@name     pattern_events
@alias    yc
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_events
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  enable or disable control events on active pattern
@doc
Sets control event generation for active pattern (0:disable, 1:enable).
Usage: yc state (or pattern_events state)
@code
    if (!ctx) return -1;
    seq_control_events_set(ctx->pattern, (int)args[0]);
    return 0;
@end
